<title>BELGIUM: SGB says Recticel, UM stakes &quot;not forever&quot;.</title>
<headline>SGB says Recticel, UM stakes &quot;not forever&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian holding company Societe Generale de Belgique (SGB) said on Monday that its majority stakes in Belgian polyurethane foam maker Recticel SA and in Belgian non-ferrous metals group Union Miniere SA (UM) were &quot;not forever&quot;.</p>
<p>&quot;A sale (of Recticel and UM) is not on the agenda now, which does not mean that we are going to hold these stakes for ever,&quot; SGB chief executive officer was quoted as saying in the magazine of the Flemish Investment Club Federation VFB.</p>
</text>
